{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"I need to carefully parse this complex question. Let me break it down:\n\n1. There's an award created in the 2000s\n2. A book was a contender for this award, translated into 25+ languages\n3. In the 2010s, the year this book was published, another book (released the preceding year) won this award\n4. The prize-winning book's author was born in the same city where the first book's author grew up\n5. Question: What city was the first book's author born in?\n\nLet me start searching for awards created in the 2000s.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"literary award created founded 2000s international book prize\", \"book award established 2000s translated twenty five languages\", \"international literary prize founded 2000s debut\"], \"top_k\": 10}","name":"search"},"id":"call_df3d8b0fe6e24f809606529b","index":0,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789490101,"id":"chatcmpl-eb6c9472-5bfd-906b-90ea-640220a73319","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":3870,"completion_tokens":180,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":4050,"cached_tokens":3840,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":3840},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}